WEBVTT

01:24.100 --> 01:29.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

01:46.500 --> 01:49.000
<b>Park Ticket Gate</b>

01:52.840 --> 02:01.350
<i>I'm a high-ranking officer of the Evil League,
which fights daily to wipe out humankind</i>

02:01.350 --> 02:08.640
<i>and claim the Earth in the 
name of our home planet.</i>

02:10.520 --> 02:11.480
<i>However...</i>

02:12.730 --> 02:14.900
<i>Today is my day off.</i>

02:14.900 --> 02:16.490
<b>Tickets</b>

02:16.490 --> 02:19.660
<b>Panda Enclosure</b>

02:16.780 --> 02:19.360
The line to view the pandas starts here!

02:20.160 --> 02:27.250
<i>I begin my days off with a delicious meal
 and a feast for the eyes.</i>

02:29.460 --> 02:33.040
<i>Cuddly things are excellent for this purpose.</i>

02:37.630 --> 02:39.630
Mister, aren't you overdoing it?

02:39.630 --> 02:41.140
That's a lot of pictures!

02:41.140 --> 02:45.430
<i>Once humanity is eradicated, 
I'll proliferate the pandas.</i>

02:45.430 --> 02:50.890
<i>Now, the most important thing...
 is to get as far as I can from my work.</i>

02:51.770 --> 02:55.400
<i>If I'm unlucky enough to 
bump into a coworker in town...</i>

02:55.400 --> 02:56.190
Hey there!

02:56.190 --> 02:59.700
<i>I get myself out of there with 
the grace of a shooting star.</i>

03:00.780 --> 03:01.950
<i>Then later...</i>

03:02.200 --> 03:04.240
That was you at the store, right?

03:04.240 --> 03:06.540
You had the hardest time
 picking out ice cream.

03:06.540 --> 03:10.960
<i>If they say such things,
 I pretend to be clueless.</i>

03:10.960 --> 03:13.080
Oh, maybe it was someone else...

03:13.080 --> 03:15.460
I could have sworn it was you, though.

03:15.460 --> 03:17.960
<b>Panda Enclosure</b>

03:15.710 --> 03:17.710
<i>With that, my plan is flawless.</i>

03:18.510 --> 03:22.510
<i>However, I must still watch 
out for the Rangers.</i>

03:23.010 --> 03:29.350
<i>Those lowly human fools insist 
on resisting us at every turn!</i>

03:30.770 --> 03:34.400
<i>And their skills are certainly 
not to be taken lightly.</i>

03:43.780 --> 03:48.620
<i>But I would never do battle 
with the Rangers today.</i>

03:49.200 --> 03:51.250
<i>Yes, because after all...</i>

03:52.620 --> 03:54.540
Excuse me, you there.

03:54.750 --> 03:56.880
You're from the Evil League, aren't you?

03:57.590 --> 04:00.880
I sense villainous cosmic 
energy coming from you.

04:05.760 --> 04:09.930
Sucks for you, running into 
me while I'm on patrol!

04:12.310 --> 04:15.150
I, Ranger Dawn Red, challenge you to battle!

04:25.700 --> 04:30.660
How about a truce for today, Ranger?

04:31.000 --> 04:32.080
What?!

04:34.790 --> 04:37.210
I like pandas, you see.

04:37.210 --> 04:41.960
Why fight here and scare the poor things?

04:41.960 --> 04:42.880
Wuh...

04:44.050 --> 04:45.510
I like them, too.

04:45.510 --> 04:47.590
You have good taste, Ranger.

04:48.800 --> 04:52.350
By the way, that ticket you're holding...

04:52.770 --> 04:55.640
Isn't that admission for the aquarium?

04:55.640 --> 04:58.020
W-Well, I...

04:58.860 --> 05:02.610
You couldn't possibly be 
at the zoo by mistake

05:02.610 --> 05:07.240
when you're scheduled to patrol 
the aquarium, could you?

05:11.200 --> 05:12.870
How'd you know?

05:13.370 --> 05:17.790
From Uenono Station, get off at the ninth 
stop. The aquarium's right there.

05:19.080 --> 05:21.300
Now then, I must be going—

05:21.300 --> 05:22.090
Um!

05:31.760 --> 05:35.140
How do I... get to the station?

05:35.180 --> 05:37.940
Ranger Dawn Red has absolutely 
no sense of direction!

05:37.940 --> 05:43.440
I fail so hard at going 
back the way I came...

05:54.750 --> 05:56.080
<b>Uenono</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:56.080
<b>Shinanogawa</b>

06:01.670 --> 06:03.090
<b>Private Use</b>

06:08.300 --> 06:13.600
<i>Maybe the wait to see
 the pandas is shorter by now.</i>

06:13.810 --> 06:17.980
Oh no! Which train do I take?!

06:13.810 --> 06:18.940
<b>Ticket Gate</b>

06:20.440 --> 06:22.610
<i>I think I'll go get in line again.</i>

06:24.650 --> 06:28.740
<i>I would never do battle 
with the Rangers today.</i>

06:29.280 --> 06:34.620
<i>Yes, because after all, it's my day off.</i>

06:40.790 --> 06:43.090
<i>The convenience store...</i>

06:43.790 --> 06:49.720
<i>A location where one can find
 a variety of items,</i>

06:48.090 --> 06:54.050
Rice ball fillings you're sure to love

06:49.720 --> 06:53.680
<i>from groceries to daily 
necessities to publications.</i>

06:54.050 --> 06:57.060
Recommended

06:54.680 --> 06:56.430
Welcome!

06:56.430 --> 06:57.560
Welcome!

