07:14.070 --> 07:15.580
Cup Noodles

07:14.450 --> 07:16.950
<i>The abundant range of goods is striking,</i>

07:15.580 --> 07:16.950
<b>Bean Jam Bun</b>

07:15.580 --> 07:16.950
<b>Bean Jam Bun</b>

07:15.580 --> 07:16.950
<b>Cinnamon Rolls</b>

