<b>Calligraphy Pen</b>

07:18.410 --> 07:19.830
<b>Highlighter</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:21.330
<b>SHAMPOO</b>

07:21.330 --> 07:22.960
<b>Seasonal Travel</b>

07:21.330 --> 07:22.960
<b><i>Simple Sides</i></b>

07:22.960 --> 07:24.590
<b>Seasonal
 Lunch</b>

07:22.960 --> 07:24.590
<b>Variety Lunch</b>

07:25.290 --> 07:30.090
<i>Of everything available, there's one thing 
in particular that pleases me.</i>

07:36.100 --> 07:41.190
<i>They had red sweet potato soft serve
here until yesterday, and now it's gone?!</i>

07:41.480 --> 07:46.110
<i>And there's another product in its place?!</i>

07:44.360 --> 07:48.860
<b>Winter Exclusive</b>

07:44.360 --> 07:48.860
<b>Strawberry Mochi Bar</b>

07:46.110 --> 07:48.860
<i>"Winter Exclusive Strawberry Mochi Bar"?!</i>

07:48.860 --> 07:53.320
<b>Strawberry Mochi Bar</b>

07:49.230 --> 07:51.320
<i>What the hell is that?!</i>

07:51.820 --> 07:56.450
<i>I believe "strawberry" refers to a red fruit.</i>

07:56.830 --> 07:59.790
<i>Mochi? What is "mochi"?</i>

07:59.790 --> 08:01.330
<i>Does it pertain to texture?</i>

08:01.460 --> 08:05.080
<b>DOOM</b>

08:09.590 --> 08:11.260
<i>What's the matter with him?</i>

08:20.060 --> 08:21.980
<b>Gloom...</b>

08:23.810 --> 08:25.770
<i>He's devastated!</i>

08:25.770 --> 08:28.070
<i>Can he not find what he wanted?</i>

08:28.070 --> 08:30.990
<i>I'm sorry! I just got done
 changing out the stock!</i>

08:31.280 --> 08:37.320
Yamano

08:31.610 --> 08:34.360
<i>We have plenty of other tasty treats!</i>

08:34.360 --> 08:35.860
<i>Like the strawberry mochi bar!</i>

08:35.860 --> 08:37.320
<i>I recommend it!</i>

08:37.320 --> 08:38.780
<i>Really!</i>

08:40.540 --> 08:42.120
<i>I'll play your game.</i>

08:42.120 --> 08:46.330
<i>There'll be hell to pay if this 
strawberry mochi thing tastes bad.</i>

08:46.710 --> 08:50.210
<i>Mark my words, Earthlings!</i>

08:50.500 --> 08:52.210
I'll take these.

08:53.590 --> 08:54.930
Yes, sir!

08:54.930 --> 08:56.890
Oh, nice.

08:56.890 --> 09:00.760
We just started selling these.
They're pretty good.

09:02.140 --> 09:03.350
I recommend them.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.270
Huh?

09:07.190 --> 09:09.320
I-I-I'm sorry, I just...

09:09.320 --> 09:14.150
I like ice cream too, so I can't help 
but buy all the new kinds we get in.

09:14.150 --> 09:18.820
N-Nothing beats a winter ice cream break
in a warm room, you know?

09:18.820 --> 09:19.780
Right?

09:27.420 --> 09:30.960
Now I've done it!

09:27.580 --> 09:29.340
I-I'm sorry!

09:29.340 --> 09:30.630
I'll give it a try.

09:32.840 --> 09:34.970
Since you recommend it.

09:35.840 --> 09:37.680
R-Right!

09:38.800 --> 09:41.010
Thank you very much.

09:44.850 --> 09:47.390
<i>In a warm room, huh?</i>

09:47.390 --> 09:52.270
<i>I've always eaten ice cream in the cold
for fear it would melt.</i>

09:58.990 --> 10:00.240
<i>There we go.</i>

10:32.400 --> 10:34.150
That's not bad.

10:34.730 --> 10:39.360
<i>In the near future, we'll wipe 
humanity from this planet.</i>

10:39.360 --> 10:44.410
<i>But maybe I'd be willing to spare 
that store until the very end.</i>

10:45.410 --> 10:48.910
Ranger Collab Meat Buns

10:46.870 --> 10:51.210
Three Ranger collaboration meat buns
 and pizza buns, please.

10:51.540 --> 10:52.960
Coming right up!

10:52.960 --> 10:55.130
<i>Wait, the Red Ranger?!</i>

10:55.130 --> 10:57.380
<i>In the flesh?! Just look at that face!</i>

10:57.970 --> 11:02.930
And if you don't mind me asking,
is the place on this map near here?

11:02.930 --> 11:04.970
Let's see...

11:04.970 --> 11:07.810
I think that's in a neighboring prefecture.

11:08.060 --> 11:08.730
Huh?

11:09.230 --> 11:09.890
Huh?

11:10.060 --> 11:10.770
Huh?

11:11.060 --> 11:11.600
Huh?

11:11.980 --> 11:12.730
Huh?

11:13.480 --> 11:14.270
Huh...?

11:15.030 --> 11:21.030
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

11:15.030 --> 11:21.030
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

11:21.820 --> 11:27.490
<i>I am a high-ranking officer
 of the Evil League.</i>

11:32.540 --> 11:35.170
Another day off...

12:18.590 --> 12:21.220
Maybe I'll do laundry or something today.

12:27.220 --> 12:31.100
<i>All I have are eggs and milk.</i>

12:34.230 --> 12:36.980
<b>Choujun</b>

13:00.090 --> 13:03.420
<i>Make the most of your days off.</i>

13:03.670 --> 13:09.180
<i>Take it from me, for I'm an evil mastermind.</i>

13:12.220 --> 13:18.270
<i>There are many creatures here on Earth 
that don't live on my home world.</i>

13:18.730 --> 13:21.190
<i>Cats, for instance.</i>

13:21.440 --> 13:23.780
So you're one of those "cat" things.

13:23.990 --> 13:25.070
<b>Meow</b>

13:24.860 --> 13:28.620
Apparently the breed is 
"Nor Wegianfor Est cat."

13:28.620 --> 13:30.870
That's one long-ass name.

13:31.580 --> 13:33.200
Its body is long, too...

13:33.200 --> 13:36.580
<b><i>\h\h\hTremble

Tremble</i></b>

13:33.200 --> 13:36.580
<b><i>Tremble

Tremble\h\h\h\h\h\h</i></b>

13:33.450 --> 13:36.040
<i>Dogs are another example.</i>

13:36.960 --> 13:40.590
What the hell are you shaking for?

13:40.590 --> 13:42.550
Cold, are you?

13:42.550 --> 13:44.130
Hey, go get a blanket.

13:44.130 --> 13:45.170
Yes, sir!

13:45.170 --> 13:48.090
<i>But then there's this creature.</i>

13:46.010 --> 13:50.760
<b><i>Black-and-White Furball</i></b>

13:48.090 --> 13:50.760
<i>Just what is this thing?</i>

13:51.260 --> 13:59.900
<i>To find out, I once went out investigating 
even though it was my day off.</i>

13:59.900 --> 14:01.570
I'm first!

14:02.020 --> 14:08.990
<i>This counted as work, by the way,
so I requested comp time to make up for it.</i>

14:12.910 --> 14:14.500
<b>Okapi</b>

14:14.750 --> 14:16.500
<b>Maned Wolf</b>

14:16.620 --> 14:18.710
<b>Pallas's Cat</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:21.500
<b>Shoebill</b>

14:21.750 --> 14:24.000
<b>Naked Mole-Rat</b>

14:27.170 --> 14:29.050
<i>What is this place?</i>

14:29.050 --> 14:32.760
<i>There are all kinds of creatures, 
not just the black-and-white furball.</i>

14:35.390 --> 14:38.440
<b>Lions</b>

14:35.390 --> 14:38.440
<b>Tigers</b>

14:35.390 --> 14:38.440
<b>Gibbons</b>

14:35.640 --> 14:38.440
<i>Lions and tigers?</i>

14:38.440 --> 14:40.190
<i>Sequestering even large carnivores?</i>

14:40.190 --> 14:42.980
<i>What are you up to, Earthlings?</i>

14:44.110 --> 14:47.360
<i>Could this be some experimental facility?!</i>

14:48.240 --> 14:49.820
We can never let down our guard!

14:49.820 --> 14:50.740
Mommy.

14:50.740 --> 14:52.740
No pointing!

14:52.740 --> 14:58.040
<i>No matter. My objective for today 
is the black-and-white furball.</i>

14:59.460 --> 15:02.250
<i>But you'll get what's coming to you!</i>

15:03.000 --> 15:06.760
<i>At a later date, this is 
what I wrote in my report:</i>

15:08.300 --> 15:10.090
<i>"I'd like to visit again."</i>

15:13.180 --> 15:18.430
<i>Thus did I wind up encountering pandas.</i>

15:35.240 --> 15:37.580
You, nice guy from the Evil League!

15:39.790 --> 15:42.880
Thank you very much for the other day.

15:42.880 --> 15:45.210
Please accept this as thanks!

15:50.470 --> 15:52.380
So you <i>do</i> know the score.

15:54.010 --> 15:56.260
Is our truce still in effect today?

15:57.390 --> 16:00.810
<i>I would never do battle
with the Rangers today.</i>

16:01.310 --> 16:05.190
<i>Because after all, it's my day off.</i>

16:09.360 --> 16:14.410
<i>Indeed, I value my time off above all else.</i>

16:14.410 --> 16:19.120
<i>Days off should begin with quality 
sleep and delicious food.</i>

16:19.120 --> 16:24.830
<i>But what you must remember most
is to get as far as possible from work.</i>

16:25.750 --> 16:30.300
<i>After going shopping 
and carelessly running into a Ranger,</i>

16:30.880 --> 16:34.260
<i>then nearly encountering
 a coworker at the supermarket,</i>

16:34.260 --> 16:37.300
<i>I got myself out of there 
with the grace of a shooting star.</i>

16:38.010 --> 16:41.480
<i>Thus did I flawlessly defend my day off.</i>

16:42.520 --> 16:46.980
But now I'm seething with rage!

16:46.980 --> 16:49.110
It's my day off, and what of it?!

16:49.320 --> 16:53.860
I worked all week with the intent
 to have curry tonight!

16:54.320 --> 16:58.280
But they only had <i>extra-spicy</i>
 roux and not mild!

16:58.280 --> 17:01.950
I can't eat this! Damn you, Earthlings!

17:01.950 --> 17:04.290
Today's the day I kill you all!

17:04.540 --> 17:06.920
<i>Coming up, we have a panda special!</i>

17:07.710 --> 17:10.500
<i>The sheer sight of them enjoying their bamboo</i>

17:10.500 --> 17:12.920
<i>makes them the stars of the animal world!</i>

17:13.420 --> 17:17.220
<i>Sometimes they lie around, 
sometimes they roll around.</i>

17:17.220 --> 17:21.270
<i>Our visitors are head over heels 
for their charming antics!</i>

17:21.520 --> 17:25.440
<i>We can't wait for the baby panda's 
first public appearance next week!</i>

17:25.440 --> 17:29.730
<i>On this day, cuteness saved the world.</i>

17:29.980 --> 17:35.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

17:29.980 --> 17:35.980
<b>Mr. Villain's Day Off</b>

17:38.810 --> 17:40.980
<i>I have the day off today.</i>

17:41.610 --> 17:46.280
<i>I'm visiting a place called
 a "shopping mall."</i>

17:47.950 --> 17:49.450
<i>An enemy attack?!</i>

17:49.450 --> 17:51.080
Daddy!

17:56.830 --> 17:58.500
You're not our daddy...

18:02.540 --> 18:03.630
Mister!

18:03.630 --> 18:05.090
We want some of that!

18:05.090 --> 18:11.100
Hasn't your family ever taught you 
not to accept food from strangers?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.220
Nope!

18:14.310 --> 18:17.270
<i>How the hell do they raise 
kids on this planet?</i>

18:20.310 --> 18:23.480
Okay, but you're getting cups and not cones.

18:23.480 --> 18:24.440
How come?

18:24.440 --> 18:25.480
We don't want that.

18:25.690 --> 18:27.990
Cups are safer.

18:26.990 --> 18:28.490
Prone to falling

18:28.780 --> 18:31.240
Cones are cooler.

18:30.110 --> 18:31.490
<b>Uncool</b>

18:30.110 --> 18:31.490
<b>Dumb</b>

18:35.450 --> 18:37.000
That is true.

18:37.000 --> 18:40.960
Order cones then, 
but make sure not to drop anything.

18:42.630 --> 18:46.760
<i>Even their dad thinks cones are cooler.</i>

18:47.130 --> 18:50.630
We're going straight 
to the lost children center next, kids.

18:52.220 --> 18:56.390
Thanks, Mr. Stranger Who's Not Our Daddy!

18:57.470 --> 19:00.140
Do not call me that here.

19:02.690 --> 19:05.070
Just kidding! Thanks!

19:12.780 --> 19:14.870
Hey, you okay?

19:14.870 --> 19:16.330
My ice cream...

19:16.330 --> 19:18.250
I told you to be careful.

19:18.500 --> 19:21.710
My ice cream!

19:21.710 --> 19:23.130
Don't cry.

19:23.130 --> 19:27.880
We're almost to the lost child center, 
and you'll get to see your daddy there, okay?

19:26.300 --> 19:28.260
Very much panicking inside

19:28.630 --> 19:29.880
Mister.

19:30.670 --> 19:33.890
I think one of those would cheer her up.

19:34.510 --> 19:38.140
It would. Pretty please...

19:38.640 --> 19:41.390
Mr. Stranger Who's Not Our Daddy.

19:42.730 --> 19:46.270
I told you not to call me that.

19:42.980 --> 19:46.900
<b>I told you...
not to call me that</b>

19:44.020 --> 19:46.900
<b>not to call me that</b>

19:46.900 --> 19:49.190
Thanks, Mister!

19:49.650 --> 19:52.150
Ring bell for service

19:49.900 --> 19:51.820
Thanks a lot.

19:54.620 --> 19:56.080
See you around!

19:58.540 --> 20:02.710
<i>I'm sure we'll never meet again.</i>

20:04.790 --> 20:07.170
Stick close to your daddy from now on.

20:07.170 --> 20:08.420
We will!

20:08.670 --> 20:13.440
<i>By the time you grow up, 
humanity will have perished.</i>

20:13.780 --> 20:19.430
<i>So I shall make it a point to remember 
the warmth of your tiny hands.</i>

20:30.130 --> 20:32.790
He wasn't as evil as I thought he'd be.

20:32.790 --> 20:35.580
The enemy has all sorts, too.

20:35.580 --> 20:38.030
We were just observing him this time.

20:38.030 --> 20:41.100
Yes, and by the time we next meet...

20:41.690 --> 20:43.060
Mugi! Sora!

20:43.480 --> 20:45.700
You both came!

20:45.700 --> 20:47.010
As always, I appreciate it.

20:47.220 --> 20:50.860
I'm impressed you made it to the 
lost children center by yourself.

20:50.860 --> 20:54.580
You've definitely grown some, Red.

20:54.580 --> 20:55.690
Thanks!

20:56.890 --> 20:58.250
<i>It's those two kids.</i>

21:05.860 --> 21:10.110
<i>So that really was some stranger
 and not their dad...?</i>

21:10.490 --> 21:13.210
Since we're here, want anything to eat?

21:13.210 --> 21:14.120
Maybe ice cream?

21:16.460 --> 21:17.940
Not right now.

21:17.940 --> 21:19.000
No?

21:19.660 --> 21:21.810
We're full.

21:25.310 --> 21:28.140
Blue and Pink will be worried.

21:28.140 --> 21:30.660
Let's not keep them waiting at home.

21:30.660 --> 21:31.480
Sure.

